1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:09,900
Slide 30 brings us to "The Digital Mandate." As we build these powerful tools, what moral principles guide us?

2
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:22,480
First is Technological Sovereignty. You should own your own data, your own models, and your own private keys. Never surrender complete control to a single centralized monopoly.

3
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:35,280
Second is Architectural Integrity. Your systems must have transparent logs. An avatar must never lie, fabricate data, or conceal errors.

4
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:45,320
And third is Service. The ultimate test of any technology is: Does it bring peace, focus, and blessing to your family and your community?

5
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:52,620
If an AI creates chaos and anxiety, it has failed, no matter how fast it runs.

